# Copy to .dev.vars for `pnpm dev`. The real values are never committed:
# .dev.vars is gitignored, and production reads them from `wrangler secret put`.
#
# Local development needs its own GitHub OAuth App, because an OAuth App has a
# single callback URL and production's is https://editor.araya.dev/auth/callback.
# Register a second one with http://localhost:8787/auth/callback.
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# openssl rand -base64 32
SESSION_SECRET=
